1. THE OPEN ITEM: 100 USD POSTED TO 414100C AT 1 USD = 100 JPY
   a. SKB1-XSALH on:
     1800000200  WAERS USD  WRBTR      100  DMBTR    10000 JPY  PSWSL JPY  PSWBT    10000   (SE16: DMBTR 100.00, PSWBT 100.00)
   b. SKB1-XSALH off:
     1800000196  WAERS USD  WRBTR      100  DMBTR    10000 JPY  PSWSL USD  PSWBT      100   (SE16: DMBTR 100.00, PSWBT 100.00)
   Same document currency, same local amount. The only difference is the pair on the right:
   with the flag the account remembers a JPY balance, without it a USD balance.

2. PROCESS THE ITEM IN F-03, IN JPY, WHEN THE RATE IS 1 USD = 110 JPY
   a. flag on:   JPY Gross shown =   10000   DMBTR is not recalculated
   b. flag off:  JPY Gross shown =   11000   DMBTR is recalculated from 100 USD
   Case a clears against 10,000 JPY of anything. Case b needs 11,000 JPY, or a difference.

3. HOW THE FLAG CHANGES A CLEARING BETWEEN TWO ITEMS OF THE SAME LOCAL AMOUNT
   flag off, two items, both 10,000 JPY in DMBTR, one posted in USD and one in JPY:
     1800000196  WAERS USD  WRBTR     -100  DMBTR   -10000 JPY  PSWSL USD  PSWBT     -100   (SE16: DMBTR -100.00, PSWBT -100.00)
     1800000201  WAERS JPY  WRBTR    10000  DMBTR    10000 JPY  PSWSL JPY  PSWBT    10000   (SE16: DMBTR 100.00, PSWBT 100.00)
   net amounts at the clearing rate:  1800000196  -11000 JPY   1800000201   10000 JPY
   balance in JPY = -1000  -> the items cannot be cleared as they stand.
   Options: 'Charge off diff.' or a residual item of 1000 JPY, and the system posts an
   exchange rate difference of 1000 JPY to the account in OBA1 (transaction KDF).

   flag on for both items:
   net amounts:  -10000 and   10000  balance 0 -> cleared with no difference line at all.

4. T001-XSLTA: 'NO FOREX RATE DIFF. WHEN CLEARING IN LC' (OBY6)
   flag off, XSLTA set, clearing entered in JPY: 1800000196 keeps its DMBTR, balance 0.
   The company code indicator switches the recalculation off for clearings done in local
   currency; the account keeps its USD balance and no difference is posted.

5. THE SAME NUMBERS SEEN AS BALANCES OF 414100C IN UPDATE CURRENCY
   flag off: JPY    10000   USD     -100
   flag on : JPY        0
   With the flag off the account has a USD bucket and a JPY bucket, and clearing the
   two items against each other has to bring BOTH to zero -- which is why a clearing
   document can contain lines nobody entered.
